{"id":"14-git","number":14,"slug":"git-for-coding-agents","title":"Git is your safety net","short":"Git is your safety net","module":"Your toolkit","summary":"Agents make mistakes fast; git lets you undo them faster. And every coding agent is fluent in git, including the parts nobody remembers. Use commits as save points, history as research material, bisect for bug hunts, and branches to keep work isolated.","voice":"Eric","scenes":[{"template":"title","chapter":"Intro","narration":"Agents make mistakes fast. Git lets you undo them faster. And it turns out every coding agent is fluent in git, including the commands nobody can remember.","params":{"kicker":"Lesson 14","module":"Module 3 · Your toolkit","title":"Git is your *safety net*","subtitle":"Save points, history, and fearless experiments.","bubble":"I speak fluent git.","mood":"happy"},"start":0.5,"dur":11.466,"words":[{"text":"Agents","s":0.8,"e":1.28},{"text":"make","s":1.36,"e":1.52},{"text":"mistakes","s":1.64,"e":2},{"text":"fast.","s":2.16,"e":2.88},{"text":"Git","s":3.12,"e":3.36},{"text":"lets","s":3.48,"e":3.6},{"text":"you","s":3.64,"e":3.68},{"text":"undo","s":3.76,"e":4.08},{"text":"them","s":4.16,"e":4.32},{"text":"faster.","s":4.4,"e":5.12},{"text":"And","s":5.36,"e":5.44},{"text":"it","s":5.48,"e":5.52},{"text":"turns","s":5.64,"e":5.84},{"text":"out","s":5.92,"e":6.16},{"text":"every","s":6.32,"e":6.56},{"text":"coding","s":6.64,"e":6.96},{"text":"agent","s":7.12,"e":7.28},{"text":"is","s":7.36,"e":7.44},{"text":"fluent","s":7.52,"e":7.84},{"text":"in","s":7.92,"e":8},{"text":"git,","s":8.08,"e":8.64},{"text":"including","s":8.88,"e":9.12},{"text":"the","s":9.16,"e":9.2},{"text":"commands","s":9.28,"e":9.68},{"text":"nobody","s":9.76,"e":10.16},{"text":"can","s":10.24,"e":10.32},{"text":"remember.","s":10.4,"e":11.12}]},{"template":"quote","chapter":"Fluent in git","narration":"Simon Willison points out that all the coding agents are fluent in git's features, both basic and advanced. That means we can be more ambitious with git ourselves. We don't need to memorize how to do things. We just need to know what's possible.","params":{"text":"We don't need to memorize *how* to do things with Git, but staying aware of what's possible means we can take advantage of the full suite.","who":"Simon Willison","role":"Agentic Engineering Patterns","src":"Using Git with coding agents"},"start":11.966,"dur":15.056,"words":[{"text":"Simon","s":12.266,"e":12.666},{"text":"Willison","s":12.746,"e":13.226},{"text":"points","s":13.386,"e":13.546},{"text":"out","s":13.666,"e":13.786},{"text":"that","s":13.906,"e":14.026},{"text":"all","s":14.146,"e":14.266},{"text":"the","s":14.306,"e":14.346},{"text":"coding","s":14.426,"e":14.666},{"text":"agents","s":14.746,"e":15.066},{"text":"are","s":15.146,"e":15.306},{"text":"fluent","s":15.386,"e":15.706},{"text":"in","s":15.786,"e":15.866},{"text":"git's","s":15.946,"e":16.186},{"text":"features,","s":16.426,"e":16.906},{"text":"both","s":17.026,"e":17.146},{"text":"basic","s":17.426,"e":17.706},{"text":"and","s":17.826,"e":17.946},{"text":"advanced.","s":18.226,"e":19.066},{"text":"That","s":19.146,"e":19.226},{"text":"means","s":19.306,"e":19.546},{"text":"we","s":19.626,"e":19.706},{"text":"can","s":19.786,"e":19.866},{"text":"be","s":19.946,"e":20.026},{"text":"more","s":20.106,"e":20.186},{"text":"ambitious","s":20.306,"e":20.746},{"text":"with","s":20.826,"e":20.906},{"text":"git","s":20.986,"e":21.066},{"text":"ourselves.","s":21.146,"e":22.186},{"text":"We","s":22.226,"e":22.266},{"text":"don't","s":22.306,"e":22.426},{"text":"need","s":22.506,"e":22.586},{"text":"to","s":22.666,"e":22.826},{"text":"memorize","s":22.906,"e":23.386},{"text":"how","s":23.426,"e":23.466},{"text":"to","s":23.546,"e":23.626},{"text":"do","s":23.706,"e":23.866},{"text":"things.","s":24.066,"e":24.586},{"text":"We","s":24.666,"e":24.746},{"text":"just","s":24.826,"e":24.906},{"text":"need","s":24.986,"e":25.066},{"text":"to","s":25.146,"e":25.226}